      "size": 217640,
      "sample_rate": 16000,
      "samples": 177040,
      "transcript": "SHE TAUGHT HER DAUGHTER THEN BY HER OWN AFFECTION FOR IT THAT LOVE FOR A COUNTRY WHERE THEY HAD BOTH BEEN HOSPITABLY RECEIVED AND WHERE A BRILLIANT FUTURE OPENED BEFORE THEM"
    },
    {
      "row": 5,
      "id": "6930-75918-0005",
      "file": "6930-75918-0005.flac",
      "sha256": "ccc0da025ef4f4596a4e70fbde291527d140364166d19d9bb516a48407b3491e",
      "size": 261183,
      "sample_rate": 16000,
      "samples": 210560,
      "transcript": "THE COUNT HAD THROWN HIMSELF BACK ON HIS SEAT LEANING HIS SHOULDERS AGAINST THE PARTITION OF THE TENT AND REMAINED THUS HIS FACE BURIED IN HIS HANDS WITH HEAVING CHEST AND RESTLESS LIMBS"
    },
    {
      "row": 6,
